(137, 'PORYGON', 'Porygon', 'NORMAL', NULL, 65, 60, 70, 85, 75, 40, 'Genderless', 'Medium', 79, 45, 50, 'TRACE', 'DOWNLOAD', 'ANALYTIC', 'Mineral', 5120, 0.8, 36.5, 'Pink', 'HeadLegs', 'Urban', 'Virtual', 'It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A Porygon is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated.', '1', 'PORYGON2,TradeItem,UPGRADE', '0137_Porygon'),
