(640, 'VIRIZION', 'Virizion', 'GRASS', 'FIGHTING', 91, 90, 72, 90, 129, 108, 'Genderless', 'Slow', 290, 3, 35, 'JUSTIFIED', NULL, NULL, 'Undiscovered', 20480, 2.0, 200.0, 'Green', 'Quadruped', NULL, 'Grassland', 'Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents.', '5', NULL, '0640_Virizion');
